&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr style="height: 19.07px"&gt;
&lt;td rowspan="2" style="vertical-align: middle; width: 88px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 0px none ; border-top: 0px none ; border-right: 0px none ; border-bottom: 0px none "&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;調整後払込金額&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td rowspan="2" style="vertical-align: middle; width: 18px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 0px none ; border-top: 0px none ; border-right: 0px none ; border-bottom: 0px none "&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;＝&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td rowspan="2" style="vertical-align: middle; width: 88px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 0px none ; border-top: 0px none ; border-right: 0px none ; border-bottom: 0px none "&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;調整前払込金額&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td rowspan="2" style="vertical-align: middle; width: 18px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 0px none ; border-top: 0px none ; border-right: 0px none ; border-bottom: 0px none "&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;×&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 127.06666666666666666666666667px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 0px none ; border-top: 0px none ; border-right: 0px none ; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000"&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: center"&gt;１&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height: 19.07px"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 127.06666666666666666666666667px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 0px none ; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 0px none ; border-bottom: 0px none "&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: center"&gt;分割・併合の比率&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p style="line-height: 4px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 72px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;また、新株予約権の割当日後に時価を下回る価額で新株式の発行または自己株式の処分を行う場合は、次の算式により払込金額を調整し、調整により生ずる１円未満の端数は切り上げます。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="line-height: 4px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style="margin-left: 84px"&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="table-layout: fixed; width: 551.20000000000000000000000001px"&gt;
